# Code owners are requested for review automatically on every pull request
# that touches a matching path, and branch protection can require their
# approval. This answers OPERATIONS.md's "document who can deploy, rotate
# credentials, approve production changes" for the repository itself.
#
# The last matching pattern wins. Uncomment and fill in; a CODEOWNERS file
# with only comments does nothing, which is a safe default until owners are
# named. Examples:
#
# *                         @your-org/maintainers
# /.github/                 @your-org/platform
# /docs/OPERATIONS.md       @your-org/on-call
# /docs/SECURITY.md         @your-org/security
# /constitution             @your-org/maintainers
